
 RemLib is a shell command written by Thomas Rapp.

 It makes it easy to remove a library from the
 resident list (may also work with other resources).

 If you want to remove your ROM resident icon.library
 then just make sure that you have an icon.library
 copied into your Libs: directory and then call:

 RemLib >NIL: icon.library

 from your startup-sequence before SetPatch. No path!
 This command will not load the new library resident
 and thus it won't require and cause an extra reboot.

 Many thanks to Thomas Rapp !!
